FINAL ANSWER:
Not quite one person, but close: Andrew Gallant owns about two thirds of the surviving Rust lines. I used `git blame` (`-w -M -C`) on the 10 tracked `.rs` files at HEAD, which comes to 4,366 lines.

| Author | Lines | Share |
